  "id": "creamy-baked-cauliflower-with-almond-crumbs",
  "name": "Creamy Baked Cauliflower with Almond Crumbs",
  "subtitle": "Roasted cauliflower in a savory almond-mustard sauce",
  "description": "A whole roasted cauliflower is coated in a creamy plant-based sauce, finished with crisp breadcrumbs and almonds, and baked until thick and golden.",
